{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>梁芷珮（Christy）在《南美潮什麼 2》中不只冒險，更帶觀眾體驗厄瓜多爾的地道享受！她去到海拔3,300米的高山Spa，罕有地以泳衣上陣大騷健康身材，更少女心爆發，究竟在雲霧繚繞的仙境歎溫泉有幾正？</p><p>梁芷珮見證頂級可可豆誕生 激讚傳統美食：好想買返香港</p><p>厄瓜多爾因其獨特的地理位置，包括火山、赤道、安第斯山脈高地及亞馬遜森林氣候，成為世界上出產最多頂級可可豆的國家之一。Christy親眼見證了可可豆變成朱古力的奇妙過程。美食方面，她品嘗了厄瓜多爾的傳統美食「Fritada」和「朱古力雪糕」，並讚不絕口，興奮表示：「點解可以咁正」、「味道啱啱好」、「好想買返香港」，完全被當地美食俘虜。</p><p>梁芷珮海拔3300米歎溫泉 泳衣look大擺嘟嘴Pose</p><p>除了美食，Christy還帶大家來到位於安第斯山脈高處，海拔3,300米山谷裡的Spa中心。她換上泳衣上陣，大方展示其「健康美身材」，享受礦物質豐富卻沒有硫磺味的溫泉池。浸在溫泉中的Christy更「少女心發作」，對著鏡頭大擺「嘟嘴微笑」Pose，並開心表示：「好正」、「好舒服」，完全沉醉在寫意的氛圍中。</p><p>網民羨慕行程：睇見都覺得好歎</p><p>節目播出後，不少網民都表示非常羨慕Christy的行程，大讚節目除了有冒險，亦有寫意的享受。網民留言：「個高山Spa景觀一流，睇見Christy個樣就知幾舒服！」、「終於唔使食蟲，有返啲正常美食，個朱古力雪糕睇落好正！」、「Christy身材keep得好好，好健康嘅美！」、「又冒險又歎世界，呢個旅程真係完美！」、「好想試下Fritada，俾Christy講到流晒口水。」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_14527144746a87e739b38d3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_8822902306a87e73c2318d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_9626833456a87e73fabd45.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_7212570426a87e7430aaf4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_7884521906a87e77461a1b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_17594294206a87e79a17a9a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07a_5865533826a87e7b5304cf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_6118933756a87e7e1adb2e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_6194004156a87e86c8d68e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_7975555386a87e8808fdd6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_8649669796a87e8a43384f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_20034273166a87e8cc69efd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_17842532076a87e8f106b76.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_8477419636a87e91dd1c17.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_4419890246a87e981b6bfb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15a_15859406546a87e98613d05.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_8929369886a87e9897e945.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_19157705616a87e98cdb230.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_11877114016a87e990168f9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_15964671856a87e993e81be.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_5805941886a87e9989b520.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_12277697396a87e9bfe65b5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_16818937846a87e9e6990f2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_13583971596a87e9eb74ab1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/23_13235484756a87eb2e6c3d6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/24_14660172626a87eb32c1f28.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/25_4775365336a87eb3838a65.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/26_880167336a87eb3c87a39.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27_4366904906a87eb40283fa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/28_1099352776a87eb43c63c8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/29_9910626986a87eb47a7894.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/30_2820141076a87eb4c9d4b9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/31_8159699596a87eb8c820af.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/32_1840033106a87eb915d132.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/33_1038164306a87ebb2d47e2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/34_5327316006a87ebd67fabc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/35_2223940866a87ebf767602.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/36_9795373626a87ec2a42ba2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>還有什麼演唱會消息？</p><p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇： 演唱會時間表及購票資訊 ，包括 MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排 、 容祖兒 、 鄭秀文 、 張學友 、 鄭中基 、 溫拿 、 羅志祥 等。</p><p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？</p><p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看 Netflix劇集 和 BL劇 最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些 室內好去處 室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇： 離島行程攻略 或是行山，這些 行山好去處 路線簡易，新手也適合。</p><p>Tags : tvb即時資訊 南美潮什麼2 厄瓜多爾 梁芷珮</p><p>圖片來源：TVB 資料或影片來源： 原文刊於新假期</p><p>Aug 21 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T07:48:32.303697+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1086,"images":38,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}